    "title": "Flatten Nested List Iterator",
    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "A nested list contains integers or other nested lists. Design an iterator that supports the following operations: next() \u2014 returns the next integer. hasNext() \u2014 returns whether there are more integers remaining. Process a sequence of iterator operations on the given nested list.",
